The '''HH-87 Starhopper''', also known as the '''Hutt fighter''' due to its service in the [[Hutt Clan]],<ref name="HRA 6">[[The High Republic Adventures (2021) 6|''The High Republic Adventures'' (2021) 6]]</ref> or simply the '''starhopper''', was a versatile, long range single-person<ref name="Aftermath" /> [[starfighter]] that had a long service history, being used by the Hutt Clans from at least the [[High Republic Era]]<ref name="HRA 6" /> through the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Escape from Kadavo">{{TCW|Escape from Kadavo}}</ref> These starhoppers were also in service with the [[Zygerrian Slave Empire]], which deployed them for dogfighting at the [[Battle of Kadavo]].<ref name="Escape from Kadavo">{{TCW|Escape from Kadavo}}</ref>

In [[4 ABY]], [[Wedge Antilles]] used an [[Rover|HH-87]] formerly belonging to [[Gev Hessan]] to scout several [[Outer Rim Territories|Outer Rim]] worlds for signs of hidden [[Galactic Empire|Imperial]] redoubts. When his starhopper was captured by the [[Imperial-class Star Destroyer|ISD]] [[Vigilance (Imperial-class)|''Vigilance'']] over [[Akiva]], Antilles rigged it to explode, hoping the chaos would allow him to escape.<ref name="Aftermath" /> Sometime prior to the [[attack on Tuanul]], [[Vi Moradi]] and her [[astromech droid]] [[U5-GG]] were captured in a starhopper by the [[First Order]] [[Resurgent-class Star Destroyer|''Resurgent''-class Star Destroyer]] ''[[Absolution]]''.<ref name="Phasma">[[Phasma (novel)|''Phasma'']]</ref>

{{Ship-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The HH-87 Starhopper was originally created for "[[Escape from Kadavo]]," the thirteenth episode of the [[canon]] animated series ''[[Star Wars: The Clone Wars]]''{{'}} [[The Clone Wars: Season Four|fourth season]].<ref name="Escape from Kadavo">{{TCW|Escape from Kadavo}}</ref> Its design was based on an original concept illustration for the [[Lambda-class T-4a shuttle/Legends|Imperial shuttle]] developed for the [[1983]] film [[Star Wars: Episode VI Return of the Jedi|''Star Wars'': Episode VI ''Return of the Jedi'']].<ref name="Trivia Gallery">{{SW|url=series/clone-wars/escape-from-kadavo-trivia-gallery|text="Escape from Kadavo" Trivia Gallery}} {{C|Slide 6}}</ref>

